; Key map for the Sprint 38 Track H braille line spike.
;
; APPLICATION SCOPED - these exist only while jjflexible.exe has focus, so
; they cannot shadow a JAWS command anywhere else.
;
; Deliberately disjoint from the readercapture instrument's keys
; (Insert+Shift+J / K, Insert+Control+Shift+J, Insert+Alt+J) so that if the
; two scripts are ever merged with a Use statement, nothing collides.
; Control+J is untouched: it is JJ Flexible's own leader key.

[common keys]
Insert+Shift+V=JJFSpikeStatus
JAWSKey+Shift+V=JJFSpikeStatus
Insert+Shift+B=JJFSpikeFlashPaint
JAWSKey+Shift+B=JJFSpikeFlashPaint
Insert+Shift+L=JJFSpikeStructuredToggle
JAWSKey+Shift+L=JJFSpikeStructuredToggle
Insert+Shift+R=JJFSpikeRawPaint
JAWSKey+Shift+R=JJFSpikeRawPaint
